<page type="text" lines="ocr">
  <layout>One page of text in verse, set as seven stanzas of four lines each. Running head at the top centre. Page number at the top left. A catchword at the lower right. No margin notes.</layout>
  <page_number>58</page_number>
  <running_head>GVISIACA</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>Non</catchword>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">
      <i>Regníque spretis ordinibus ferox</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2">
      <i>Edicta princeps regia subruit,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3">
      <i>Cum matre cogens, heu! tenellum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4">
      <i>Arma sequi miseranda Regem:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5" para="true">
      <i>O quàm superbo sæuiit impetu!</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>O quanta Gallis damna tulit furens!</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7">
      <i>Quantasque funestus per urbes</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>Francigenas dedit ille motu-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>s!</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10" para="true">
      <i>Sic quum quietos diluuies fera</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>Irritat amnes, &amp; pecus, &amp; domos,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>Stirpésque raptas voluit vna,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>Murmure cuncta fremunt tremendo.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14" para="true">
      <i>Sic inquieto nubilus Adria</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>Tollit procellas Africus horridas:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>Nautásque per vastum vagantes</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>Exagitat violentus æquor.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18" para="true">
      <i>Sic dira sæuit bellua, quum fames</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>Væsana[?] torquet, denteque feruido</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">
      <i>Irata prædam quum repertam,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21">
      <i>Lanigerósve greges trucidat.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22" para="true">
      <i>Hinc arua passim Gallica sanguine</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23">
      <i>Madent refuso, prædaque tristibus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24">
      <i>Feris per agros funerata</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25">
      <i>Francigenum iacuere turma.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26" para="true">
      <i>Non vrbs acerbis vnica cernitur</i>
    </l>
    <l n="27">
      <i>Intacta[?] damnis, oppida turpibus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="28">
      <i>Quassata bellis, ciuibusque</i>
    </l>
    <l n="29">
      <i>Cunctaque suis viduata lugent.</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Catchword "Non" printed at the lower right, outside the text block. Right margin shows only faint show-through from the reverse side, not transcribed. "Væsana[?]": first word of the third stanza's second line is hard to read; the letters look like V, æ, then s, a, n, a. "Intacta[?]": initial letter of the line is uncertain. Long s has been written as plain s throughout. Accents on "Regníque", "Nautásque" and "Lanigerósve" are as they appear in the scan, though they may be ink marks rather than accents.</notes>
</page>
